# Daze has two ways to be cast: "You may return an Island you control to its owner's hand rather than pay this spell's mana
# cost" is optional. Bot1, holding an Island and a Mox Sapphire, casts it for its mana cost {1}{U} with no Ability: named
# (CR 601.2b: the printed cost), and the Island stays on the battlefield, tapped; Bot2 has no mana left, so Duress is countered.

